    "problemStatement": "You are given a sequence of non-negative integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​. A pair (x,y)(x, y)(x,y), where 1≤x&lt;y≤N1 \\le x \\lt y \\le N1≤x&lt;y≤N, is an inversion if Ax&gt;AyA_x \\gt A_yAx​&gt;Ay​.\n\nYou should answer QQQ queries (numbered 111 through QQQ). For each valid iii, in the iii-th query:\n\n\nYou are given a non-negative integer KiK_iKi​.\nConsider a sequence B1,B2,…,BNB_1, B_2, \\ldots, B_NB1​,B2​,…,BN​, where Bj=Aj⊕KB_j = A_j \\oplus KBj​=Aj​⊕K for each valid jjj.\nYou should find the number of inversions in the sequence BBB.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤101 \\le T \\le 101≤T≤10",
      "1≤N,Q≤1061 \\le N, Q \\le 10^61≤N,Q≤106",
      "0≤Ki&lt;2310 \\le K_i \\lt 2^{31}0≤Ki​&lt;231 for each valid iii",
      "0≤Ai&lt;2310 \\le A_i \\lt 2^{31}0≤Ai​&lt;231 for each valid iii",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 10610^6106",
      "the sum of QQQ over all test cases does not exceed 10610^6106",
      "Subtasks**Subtask #1 (50 points):**",
      "1≤Q≤51 \\le Q \\le 51≤Q≤5",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\le N \\le 10^51≤N≤105",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 10510^5105",
      "the sum of QQQ over all test cases does not exceed 555"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and QQQ.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\neach of the next QQQ lines describes a query with a single integer KiK_iKi​.",
    "outputFormat": "For each test case, print QQQ lines. For each valid iii, the iii-th of these lines should contain a single integer ― the answer to the iii-th query.",
